WEBVTT

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:04.625
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.791 --> 00:00:07.291
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.958
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:14.375
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.166
<c.Caption-C6_1>Moshimo genki wo nakushite

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.916
<c.Caption-C7_1>Tohouni kuretatokiniwa

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:38.000
<c.Caption-C8_1>Popotan no koe wo kikuno

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:42.083
<c.Caption-C9_1>Souyo anataga sunaoni

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:44.500
<c.Caption-C10_1>Natte kokoro wo hirakeba

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:48.875
<c.Caption-C11_1>Popotan wa oshiete kureru

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.666
<c.Caption-C12_1>Anohito wa kuru? Konai?

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.416
<c.Caption-C13_1>Watashi wo suki? Kirai?

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.166
<c.Caption-C14_1>Konokoi wa uso? Honto?

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:02.333
<c.Caption-C15_1>Donna kotomo shitteruno

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:05.875
<c.Caption-C16_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:08.750
<c.Caption-C17_1>Moudame popopo

00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:13.958
<c.Caption-C18_1>Wakatterukedo yamerarenai

00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:16.416
<c.Caption-C19_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.833
<c.Caption-C20_1>Moumuri popopo

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:24.541
<c.Caption-C21_1>Yume no yumedemo akeramenaide

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.875
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:37.125
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>No, Mai!

00:01:39.416 --> 00:01:41.083
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>But that's one of your treasures...

00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:42.416
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>Let go, Mii!

00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:45.875
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>No, you can't! You can't do that!

00:01:42.709 --> 00:01:45.875
<c.Subtitle-C5_2>You can't do that!

00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:48.250
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>What's going on?!

00:01:48.458 --> 00:01:49.916
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>Mai's trying to...

00:01:49.958 --> 00:01:51.250
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>Just let go of me!

00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:57.000
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>Excuse me!

00:01:58.541 --> 00:02:00.250
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>Why are you stopping me?!

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.375
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>It's nothing!

00:02:03.375 --> 00:02:04.708
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>It's just a thing...

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:07.083
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>It's just a thing...

00:02:13.083 --> 00:02:14.208
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>Mai...

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.958
<c.Caption-C23_1>The Gift

00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:38.166
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>Do you feel better?

00:02:39.666 --> 00:02:41.458
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>Why would you do that?

00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:44.416
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>It's really hard on me

00:02:41.542 --> 00:02:44.416
<c.Subtitle-C17_2>every time I look at it.

00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:49.583
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>Hey...

00:02:49.583 --> 00:02:50.583
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>Yes?

00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:53.958
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>We're travelling through time, right?

00:02:54.458 --> 00:02:55.791
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>Yes, we are.

00:02:57.166 --> 00:02:59.666
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>We meet many people

00:02:57.167 --> 00:02:59.666
<c.Subtitle-C22_2>in many places...

00:02:59.666 --> 00:03:02.500
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>...and create fond memories...

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:06.500
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>...but in the end, we can really

00:03:02.501 --> 00:03:06.500
<c.Subtitle-C24_2>hurt those people as well.

00:03:11.916 --> 00:03:15.083
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>Maybe we're not supposed to

00:03:11.917 --> 00:03:15.083
<c.Subtitle-C25_2>get too fond of people.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.250
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>What?

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.458
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>That Keith guy told me.

00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:21.458
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>He said that I mustn't get

00:03:19.459 --> 00:03:21.458
<c.Subtitle-C28_2>too close to people...

00:03:21.458 --> 00:03:24.125
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>...and that I mustn't leave

00:03:21.459 --> 00:03:24.125
<c.Subtitle-C29_2>fond memories with others.

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:28.000
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>Maybe he's right, after all.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.500
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>That's not so!

00:03:30.875 --> 00:03:32.541
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>But think of Konami!

00:03:35.125 --> 00:03:37.583
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>We travel across time here and there.

00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:40.000
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>If we're not able to make friends

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:40.000
<c.Subtitle-C34_2>and fond memories...

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.541
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>...what's the point of our lives?

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:48.125
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>This time travel, it's too hard on me.

00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:01.583
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>Anyway, I'll take care of it.

00:04:01.583 --> 00:04:02.750
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>Thank you.

00:04:02.958 --> 00:04:03.958
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>Ai...

00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:04.833
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>Yes?

00:04:04.833 --> 00:04:08.208
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>Are we not allowed to make friends?

00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:14.916
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>I'm sorry.

00:04:14.916 --> 00:04:16.541
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>I don't really know.

00:04:17.958 --> 00:04:19.125
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>But perhaps...

00:04:19.291 --> 00:04:24.250
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>Perhaps "The One" might have

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:24.250
<c.Subtitle-C45_2>the answer to that question.

00:04:27.958 --> 00:04:31.375
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>"The One" we're looking for.

00:04:36.291 --> 00:04:37.208
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Right!

00:05:12.333 --> 00:05:15.666
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>Are we not allowed to

00:05:12.334 --> 00:05:15.666
<c.Subtitle-C48_2>be friends with people?

00:05:15.833 --> 00:05:19.583
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>If only we can find "The One"

00:05:15.834 --> 00:05:19.583
<c.Subtitle-C49_2>we might get an answer.

00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:30.333
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>Mai? Are you awake?

00:05:37.166 --> 00:05:38.666
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>What about Miss Mai?

00:05:38.666 --> 00:05:41.291
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>Let's just leave her alone.

00:05:41.291 --> 00:05:43.291
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>Then what about

00:05:41.292 --> 00:05:43.291
<c.Subtitle-C53_2>the search for Popotan?

00:05:43.791 --> 00:05:45.583
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>I'll go on my own.

00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:48.666
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>I believe you have to go shopping?

00:05:48.666 --> 00:05:49.750
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>Yes.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.000
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>And we can't leave Mai on her own.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.333
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>Mii, I'm counting on you

00:05:52.001 --> 00:05:54.333
<c.Subtitle-C58_2>to watch the house.

00:05:54.625 --> 00:05:56.125
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>Okay! I've got it!

00:05:56.458 --> 00:05:58.041
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>Thank you for covering for me.

00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:44.625
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>It's you.

00:06:44.625 --> 00:06:45.500
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>Hey.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.166
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>Forget it.

00:06:51.001 --> 00:06:53.166
<c.Subtitle-C63_2>You're not strong enough.

00:06:53.166 --> 00:06:54.291
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>Why follow me?

00:06:54.291 --> 00:06:55.833
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>I want to talk to you.

00:06:55.833 --> 00:06:57.041
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>I don't.

00:06:57.041 --> 00:06:58.916
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>Oh, come on now.

00:07:01.708 --> 00:07:04.291
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>We're both on the same case, right?

00:07:06.375 --> 00:07:08.375
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>I'll have coffee, and...

00:07:08.375 --> 00:07:09.541
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>Milk.

00:07:11.666 --> 00:07:13.000
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>Milk, huh?

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.208
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>Doesn't suit you.

00:07:14.208 --> 00:07:15.750
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>I don't care about your opinion.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:17.500
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>Now, now.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.541
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Let's just get along.

00:07:20.166 --> 00:07:22.625
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>I'm one who "guides"

00:07:20.167 --> 00:07:22.625
<c.Subtitle-C76_2>those who go on journeys.

00:07:22.625 --> 00:07:25.875
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>And you are one who "guards"

00:07:22.626 --> 00:07:25.875
<c.Subtitle-C77_2>those who go on journeys.

00:07:26.166 --> 00:07:28.791
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>For example, back then...

00:07:39.291 --> 00:07:41.541
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>You handled the situation fairly well...

00:07:41.541 --> 00:07:44.583
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>...but I think I would've done much better.

00:07:46.166 --> 00:07:49.250
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>Anyway, that's not your business.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:52.041
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>As a "guide", I am a rank higher than you.

00:07:52.083 --> 00:07:54.208
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>Is that what you want to talk about?

00:07:54.541 --> 00:07:56.375
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>Let's get to the real issue.

00:07:56.625 --> 00:07:59.083
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>This journey is almost over.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.541
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>So I want you to do everything

00:07:59.751 --> 00:08:03.541
<c.Subtitle-C86_2>in your power to guard the girls.

00:08:03.541 --> 00:08:04.291
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>When?

00:08:04.291 --> 00:08:05.708
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>In the next jump.

00:08:06.833 --> 00:08:09.083
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>The next time, I'll be joining you.

00:08:10.041 --> 00:08:11.583
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>As a "guide".

00:08:13.708 --> 00:08:15.833
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>The destination is a special place.

00:08:15.833 --> 00:08:17.750
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>You can't get there without me.

00:08:18.916 --> 00:08:21.416
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>It's my last job as a "guide".

00:08:25.458 --> 00:08:26.458
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>It's still too soon.

00:08:26.541 --> 00:08:27.541
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>What?

00:08:29.041 --> 00:08:31.125
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>What are you talking about now?

00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:33.125
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>They are unsure of themselves.

00:08:33.125 --> 00:08:35.416
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>It's too dangerous to bring it

00:08:33.126 --> 00:08:35.416
<c.Subtitle-C98_2>to a close now.

00:08:35.416 --> 00:08:37.708
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>There's no choice here.

00:08:35.417 --> 00:08:37.708
<c.Subtitle-C99_2>That's how the route is set.

00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:39.583
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>I said they're not ready.

00:08:44.791 --> 00:08:46.916
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>We can't change the route.

00:08:46.916 --> 00:08:51.458
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>If they mess up at the end,

00:08:46.917 --> 00:08:51.458
<c.Subtitle-C102_2>then we deal with it then.

00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:52.750
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>I can't agree to it.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:55.083
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>You don't have a say in this.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.250
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>Why not?

00:08:56.916 --> 00:08:59.333
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>It is the will of "The One".

00:09:01.666 --> 00:09:04.958
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>You should be careful not to

00:09:01.667 --> 00:09:04.958
<c.Subtitle-C107_2>overstep your role as a "guard".

00:09:04.958 --> 00:09:10.333
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>And it's not as though those girls

00:09:04.959 --> 00:09:10.333
<c.Subtitle-C108_2>are your first assignment.

00:09:12.791 --> 00:09:14.208
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>Keep that in mind.

00:09:27.458 --> 00:09:29.125
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>I made it look like Mea.

00:09:35.083 --> 00:09:38.000
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>In gratitude for taking

00:09:35.084 --> 00:09:38.000
<c.Subtitle-C111_2>such good care of us...

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:39.666
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>...here's a gift.

00:09:39.708 --> 00:09:41.166
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>Th-Thank you very much.

00:09:46.916 --> 00:09:48.583
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>It's time for us to go.

00:10:03.583 --> 00:10:06.958
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>Are we not allowed to become

00:10:03.584 --> 00:10:06.958
<c.Subtitle-C115_2>friends with people?

00:10:07.125 --> 00:10:10.500
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>If only we can find "The One"

00:10:07.126 --> 00:10:10.500
<c.Subtitle-C116_2>we might get an answer.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.166
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>You think?

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:16.791
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>Yeah.

00:10:16.791 --> 00:10:18.750
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>The Popotan here told me so.

00:10:19.291 --> 00:10:20.708
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>That's great!

00:10:20.708 --> 00:10:22.708
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>We can finally meet "The One".

00:10:40.541 --> 00:10:42.500
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>Oh, really?! Is that true?!

00:10:57.125 --> 00:10:59.583
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>Hey, it's Mea. Mea!

00:11:01.833 --> 00:11:03.000
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>What's going on?

00:11:03.041 --> 00:11:05.250
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>This! This! Take a look at it!

00:11:18.625 --> 00:11:19.666
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>That's...

00:11:19.708 --> 00:11:21.791
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>The Popotan said that...

00:11:21.833 --> 00:11:24.125
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>..."The One" came here

00:11:21.834 --> 00:11:24.125
<c.Subtitle-C128_2>once before in the past.

00:11:24.125 --> 00:11:26.375
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>And that she wants to see us.

00:11:30.833 --> 00:11:33.666
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>Ai, didn't you say before that...

00:11:33.666 --> 00:11:37.750
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>...once we meet "The One",

00:11:33.667 --> 00:11:37.750
<c.Subtitle-C131_2>my troubles will be resolved?

00:11:38.083 --> 00:11:42.541
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>And that she can tell us if we can

00:11:38.084 --> 00:11:42.541
<c.Subtitle-C132_2>make friends with people?

00:11:42.916 --> 00:11:45.041
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>I think we'll have the answer

00:11:42.917 --> 00:11:45.041
<c.Subtitle-C133_2>to that very soon.

00:11:46.416 --> 00:11:48.458
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>We're going to finally meet "The One"?

00:11:48.791 --> 00:11:49.791
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>Yes!

00:11:53.291 --> 00:11:55.416
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>We're going to finally meet "The One".

00:11:57.666 --> 00:11:58.791
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>Mea?

00:12:00.333 --> 00:12:01.958
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>Oh, it's nothing.

00:12:02.375 --> 00:12:03.708
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>Excuse me.

00:12:07.125 --> 00:12:09.416
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>We did definitely meet "The One".

00:12:09.416 --> 00:12:10.416
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>But...

00:12:10.416 --> 00:12:11.541
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>But in the end...

00:12:17.958 --> 00:12:19.083
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>Popotan.

00:12:22.875 --> 00:12:23.958
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>Popotan.

00:12:35.958 --> 00:12:38.333
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>We did definitely meet "The One".

00:12:38.833 --> 00:12:39.833
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>But...

00:12:39.875 --> 00:12:43.125
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>But in the end,

00:12:39.876 --> 00:12:43.125
<c.Subtitle-C147_2>there was no answer!

00:12:44.125 --> 00:12:45.250
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>Why?

00:12:45.583 --> 00:12:48.416
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>Maybe it was because

00:12:45.584 --> 00:12:48.416
<c.Subtitle-C149_2>we were too weak.

00:12:49.833 --> 00:12:53.916
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>Maybe we shouldn't have met "The One"

00:12:49.834 --> 00:12:53.916
<c.Subtitle-C150_2>before we had resolved our troubles.

00:12:54.958 --> 00:12:56.250
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>But I'm sure...

00:12:56.291 --> 00:13:00.375
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>I'm sure that we can continue

00:12:56.292 --> 00:13:00.375
<c.Subtitle-C152_2>the journey and eventually...

00:13:00.375 --> 00:13:01.958
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>We're never going to find out!

00:13:03.333 --> 00:13:05.083
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>How can you accept that?!

00:13:05.083 --> 00:13:07.958
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>You think you can really

00:13:05.084 --> 00:13:07.958
<c.Subtitle-C155_2>carry on with this journey?!

00:13:19.166 --> 00:13:21.875
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>We travel through time and

00:13:19.167 --> 00:13:21.875
<c.Subtitle-C156_2>meet many people...

00:13:21.875 --> 00:13:24.958
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>...and create fond memories with them...

00:13:24.958 --> 00:13:28.208
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>...but in the end...

00:13:28.708 --> 00:13:31.208
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>We can hurt those people as well.

00:13:32.916 --> 00:13:35.500
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>What's the purpose of our lives?

00:13:36.833 --> 00:13:38.791
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>I don't want this anymore!

00:13:39.291 --> 00:13:41.708
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>I don't want to go on a journey anymore!

00:13:59.125 --> 00:14:01.708
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>To celebrate the fact that

00:13:59.126 --> 00:14:01.708
<c.Subtitle-C163_2>we'll be meeting "The One" soon!

00:14:02.041 --> 00:14:04.291
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>Cheers!

00:14:04.416 --> 00:14:05.708
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>Cheers!

00:14:28.708 --> 00:14:30.958
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>What are you doing, Unagi?

00:14:37.958 --> 00:14:40.458
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>But I wonder what she's like.

00:14:40.458 --> 00:14:41.666
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>"The One"?

00:14:41.833 --> 00:14:43.875
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>I really want to meet her soon!

00:14:44.166 --> 00:14:45.166
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>Yes.

00:14:50.041 --> 00:14:54.000
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>Well, we're off to meet "The One".

00:14:54.166 --> 00:14:55.500
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>Be careful.

00:15:06.208 --> 00:15:11.166
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>If only I knew what was

00:15:06.209 --> 00:15:11.166
<c.Subtitle-C173_2>going to happen, I could've...

00:15:13.083 --> 00:15:13.875
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>Um...

00:15:15.583 --> 00:15:16.708
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>What?

00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:18.583
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>Um, nothing.

00:15:20.625 --> 00:15:21.750
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>I'm sorry.

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:23.541
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>I don't have an appetite.

00:15:23.583 --> 00:15:25.416
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>Hang on, Mea.

00:15:27.291 --> 00:15:28.666
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>You see...

00:15:46.166 --> 00:15:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>What's this?

00:15:47.416 --> 00:15:51.541
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>We all went to gather flowers

00:15:47.417 --> 00:15:51.541
<c.Subtitle-C182_2>and we made that for you!

00:15:54.083 --> 00:15:55.916
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>You've really been good to us.

00:15:56.375 --> 00:16:01.208
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>We're coming to the end of our journey,

00:15:56.376 --> 00:16:01.208
<c.Subtitle-C184_2>so we thought we'd present you with a gift.

00:16:02.666 --> 00:16:04.166
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>Thank you very much.

00:16:04.583 --> 00:16:07.083
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>Oh, no. Not at all.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.083
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>What's the matter?

00:17:49.916 --> 00:17:51.958
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>I have a favor to ask.

00:17:51.958 --> 00:17:56.583
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>Don't take those three to meet

00:17:51.959 --> 00:17:56.583
<c.Subtitle-C189_2>"The One" quite yet.

00:17:56.958 --> 00:17:59.791
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>You don't want to repeat

00:17:56.959 --> 00:17:59.791
<c.Subtitle-C190_2>your mistake again?

00:18:01.166 --> 00:18:03.166
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>It's about those brothers, right?

00:18:03.166 --> 00:18:05.875
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>You don't want the three girls

00:18:03.167 --> 00:18:05.875
<c.Subtitle-C192_2>to go through the same despair.

00:18:06.125 --> 00:18:07.416
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>Don't say that!

00:18:07.541 --> 00:18:10.041
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>But this is the will of "The One".

00:18:10.041 --> 00:18:11.041
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>I know that!

00:18:16.083 --> 00:18:20.250
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>It seems like you misunderstand

00:18:16.084 --> 00:18:20.250
<c.Subtitle-C196_2>what your role is.

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:26.250
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>My role is to protect those three.

00:18:26.583 --> 00:18:28.958
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>What if I can't grant you the favor?

00:18:29.333 --> 00:18:31.791
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>If you, the "guide", weren't around...

00:18:31.791 --> 00:18:34.708
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>...then the house won't jump

00:18:31.792 --> 00:18:34.708
<c.Subtitle-C200_2>to where "The One" is.

00:18:35.333 --> 00:18:36.625
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>That's right.

00:18:36.625 --> 00:18:39.083
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>But you're no match for me.

00:19:08.166 --> 00:19:10.875
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>I'm faster than you.

00:19:21.416 --> 00:19:22.625
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>Forget it.

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:29.083
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>Have yourself a little nap.

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:42.166
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>You are definitely fast.

00:19:42.166 --> 00:19:45.000
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>But once I've got you,

00:19:42.167 --> 00:19:45.000
<c.Subtitle-C207_2>you can't fight back.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.291
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>Go to sleep.

00:20:12.583 --> 00:20:15.166
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>It looks like I made it in time.

00:20:18.166 --> 00:20:19.666
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>What is it?!

00:20:24.875 --> 00:20:25.833
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>Mea?

00:20:26.458 --> 00:20:29.125
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>Hey, what's going on?

00:20:29.125 --> 00:20:30.625
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>What happened?

00:20:30.875 --> 00:20:31.958
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>What happened?

00:20:33.875 --> 00:20:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>It was really nothing.

00:20:33.876 --> 00:20:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C215_2>It's nothing to worry about.

00:20:38.958 --> 00:20:40.291
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>Mea! Behind you!

00:20:43.166 --> 00:20:45.541
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>To think I'd let my guard down.

00:20:45.833 --> 00:20:47.166
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>Then again...

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.041
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>You let your guard down.

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:07.000
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>Keith, what are you doing?!

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.541
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>We can talk later.

00:21:08.541 --> 00:21:09.750
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>What's going on?

00:21:10.791 --> 00:21:12.625
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>Hey! What about Mea?!

00:21:12.625 --> 00:21:14.041
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>Are we leaving her?!

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.750
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>Now, let's go.

00:21:19.916 --> 00:21:21.625
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>W-Wait!

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:22.750
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>Mea!

00:21:27.875 --> 00:21:30.875
<c.Subtitle-C228_1>Mea!

00:22:11.833 --> 00:22:15.125
<c.Caption-C24_1>Tekuno panku de aishitetainoyo

00:22:15.125 --> 00:22:18.625
<c.Caption-C25_1>Denpa ni nosete daisuki suki suki

00:22:18.625 --> 00:22:22.125
<c.Caption-C26_1>Romanchikku wo anatani agetai

00:22:22.125 --> 00:22:23.750
<c.Caption-C27_1>Waratte hoshii

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:25.541
<c.Caption-C28_1>I love, love, love you

00:22:25.541 --> 00:22:28.833
<c.Caption-C29_1>S.U.K.I. dokidoki love

00:22:28.833 --> 00:22:32.333
<c.Caption-C30_1>S.U.K.I. gimigimi kiss

00:22:32.333 --> 00:22:35.875
<c.Caption-C31_1>S.U.K.I. sukisuki love

00:22:35.875 --> 00:22:39.500
<c.Caption-C32_1>S.U.K.I. sukiari kiss

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:41.208
<c.Caption-C33_1>Mawaru mawaru

00:22:41.208 --> 00:22:43.125
<c.Caption-C34_1>Jikuu no hariga

00:22:43.125 --> 00:22:46.583
<c.Caption-C35_1>Kimi to boku no zahyou wo sasuno

00:22:46.583 --> 00:22:49.750
<c.Caption-C36_1>Toketeikuwa ai no himitsu

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:54.125
<c.Caption-C37_1>Dokidoki surukoto madamada shiritaiwa

00:22:56.708 --> 00:23:03.416
<c.Caption-C38_1>Every boy, every girl kiseki wo

00:22:56.709 --> 00:23:03.416
<c.Caption-C38_2>shinjitara mirakuru kurukuru

00:23:03.875 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C39_1>Kitto mitsukaruwa beriberi

00:23:03.876 --> 00:23:10.375
<c.Caption-C39_2>surotoberi dei beriberi beriberi

00:23:10.708 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C40_1>Itsuka sayonara ga

00:23:10.709 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C40_2>yattekitatte daijoubunakurai

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:21.541
<c.Caption-C41_1>Motto anatani sukisuki daisuki tsutaetai

00:23:21.541 --> 00:23:24.625
<c.Caption-C42_1>I love you! I, I love you!

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:30.125
<c.Subtitle-C229_1>Transform! Una!

00:23:41.083 --> 00:23:44.666
<c.Subtitle-C230_1>Well, was I cute in that episode?

00:23:46.000 --> 00:24:03.166
<c.Caption-C43_1>Farewell

00:23:46.875 --> 00:23:50.125
<c.Subtitle-C231_1>Okay, the next episode of

00:23:46.876 --> 00:23:50.125
<c.Subtitle-C231_2>Popotan is "Farewell".

00:23:50.125 --> 00:23:51.666
<c.Subtitle-C232_1>Thank you for everything!

00:23:51.666 --> 00:23:54.250
<c.Subtitle-C233_1>I will never forget you all!

00:23:54.666 --> 00:23:55.291
<c.Subtitle-C234_1>Huh?

00:23:55.291 --> 00:23:57.458
<c.Subtitle-C235_1>This isn't the last episode?

00:23:57.458 --> 00:23:59.958
<c.Subtitle-C236_1>So much for my performance.

00:23:59.958 --> 00:24:03.166
<c.Subtitle-C237_1>It might look the same as usual

00:23:59.959 --> 00:24:03.166
<c.Subtitle-C237_2>but that was my very best!

00:24:07.583 --> 00:24:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C238_1>Good night, everyone!
